6:["$","$L12",null,{"destinations":[{"goodToKnowCopy":"We plan around weather, local festivals and your preferred pace. Private transfers, handpicked stays, trusted guides and 24/7 in-country support can all be woven into your journey.","goodToKnowHeading":"Best from December to April, beautiful in every season.","highlights":[{"copy":"Arrive before the day gathers pace and see the landscape in its softest light.","title":"The essential view"},{"copy":"Share seasonal food and conversation in a setting selected for character, not spectacle.","title":"A local table"},{"copy":"A generous afternoon with a thoughtful route and no obligation to hurry.","title":"Room to wander"}],"image":"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/fghpp67g/production/9f8a351d105d9493429abd1b6f9942fcbf8ab8e7-2400x3200.jpg?rect=0,775,2400,1650&w=1600&h=1100&fit=crop&auto=format","introCopy":"Sigiriya is more than a point on a map. We pair its essential landmarks with time to wander, meet people and notice the details that make a place memorable.","introHeading":"Come for the landscape.\nStay for its quieter stories.","name":"Sigiriya","note":"Ancient stone, jungle horizons","region":"Cultural Triangle","slug":"sigiriya","imageAlt":"Sigiriya"},{"goodToKnowCopy":"We plan around weather, local festivals and your preferred pace. Private transfers, handpicked stays, trusted guides and 24/7 in-country support can all be woven into your journey.","goodToKnowHeading":"Best from December to April, beautiful in every season.","highlights":[{"copy":"Arrive before the day gathers pace and see the landscape in its softest light.","title":"The essential view"},{"copy":"Share seasonal food and conversation in a setting selected for character, not spectacle.","title":"A local table"},{"copy":"A generous afternoon with a thoughtful route and no obligation to hurry.","title":"Room to wander"}],"image":"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/fghpp67g/production/6869c2eba75302d60f07c5d2a67cd749176eb2b9-1920x1200.jpg?rect=88,0,1745,1200&w=1600&h=1100&fit=crop&auto=format","introCopy":"Ella is more than a point on a map. We pair its essential landmarks with time to wander, meet people and notice the details that make a place memorable.","introHeading":"Come for the landscape.\nStay for its quieter stories.","name":"Ella","note":"Cloud forests, rails and tea","region":"Hill Country","slug":"ella","imageAlt":"Ella"},{"goodToKnowCopy":"We plan around weather, local festivals and your preferred pace. Private transfers, handpicked stays, trusted guides and 24/7 in-country support can all be woven into your journey.","goodToKnowHeading":"Best from December to April, beautiful in every season.","highlights":[{"copy":"Arrive before the day gathers pace and see the landscape in its softest light.","title":"The essential view"},{"copy":"Share seasonal food and conversation in a setting selected for character, not spectacle.","title":"A local table"},{"copy":"A generous afternoon with a thoughtful route and no obligation to hurry.","title":"Room to wander"}],"image":"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/fghpp67g/production/cdd780a27b99076cf9b2e67a2eeee2ab6f63afdc-1920x1278.jpg?rect=31,0,1859,1278&w=1600&h=1100&fit=crop&auto=format","introCopy":"Hikkaduwa is more than a point on a map. We pair its essential landmarks with time to wander, meet people and notice the details that make a place memorable.","introHeading":"Come for the landscape.\nStay for its quieter stories.","name":"Hikkaduwa","note":"Slow mornings by the Indian Ocean","region":"Southern Coast","slug":"hikkaduwa","imageAlt":"Hikkaduwa"},{"goodToKnowCopy":"We plan around weather, local festivals and your preferred pace. Private transfers, handpicked stays, trusted guides and 24/7 in-country support can all be woven into your journey.","goodToKnowHeading":"Best from December to April, beautiful in every season.","highlights":[{"copy":"Arrive before the day gathers pace and see the landscape in its softest light.","title":"The essential view"},{"copy":"Share seasonal food and conversation in a setting selected for character, not spectacle.","title":"A local table"},{"copy":"A generous afternoon with a thoughtful route and no obligation to hurry.","title":"Room to wander"}],"image":"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/fghpp67g/production/4084013af17f152369df9ac23ce75d3339c1c235-2200x1465.jpg?rect=35,0,2131,1465&w=1600&h=1100&fit=crop&auto=format","introCopy":"Yala is more than a point on a map. We pair its essential landmarks with time to wander, meet people and notice the details that make a place memorable.","introHeading":"Come for the landscape.\nStay for its quieter stories.","name":"Yala","note":"Where the wild still leads","region":"Wild South East","slug":"yala","imageAlt":"Yala"},{"goodToKnowCopy":"We plan around weather, local festivals and your preferred pace. Private transfers, handpicked stays, trusted guides and 24/7 in-country support can all be woven into your journey.","goodToKnowHeading":"Best from December to April, beautiful in every season.","highlights":[{"copy":"Arrive before the day gathers pace and see the landscape in its softest light.","title":"The essential view"},{"copy":"Share seasonal food and conversation in a setting selected for character, not spectacle.","title":"A local table"},{"copy":"A generous afternoon with a thoughtful route and no obligation to hurry.","title":"Room to wander"}],"image":"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/fghpp67g/production/6869c2eba75302d60f07c5d2a67cd749176eb2b9-1920x1200.jpg?rect=88,0,1745,1200&w=1600&h=1100&fit=crop&auto=format","introCopy":"Kandy is more than a point on a map. We pair its essential landmarks with time to wander, meet people and notice the details that make a place memorable.","introHeading":"Come for the landscape.\nStay for its quieter stories.","name":"Kandy","note":"Sacred rhythm and lake light","region":"Central Province","slug":"kandy","imageAlt":"Kandy"}],"tours":[{"days":"12 days","image":"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/fghpp67g/production/6869c2eba75302d60f07c5d2a67cd749176eb2b9-1920x1200.jpg?rect=88,0,1745,1200&w=1600&h=1100&fit=crop&auto=format","includedCopy":"Handpicked accommodation, daily breakfast, private transport, specialist hosts, selected experiences and 24/7 local assistance are included. International flights and travel insurance are excluded.","includedHeading":"Private by design.\nSupported throughout.","introCopy":"Every stay, transfer and encounter is handled. The rhythm remains spacious, and every detail can be changed around your interests.","introHeading":"A route with direction,\nnever a rigid schedule.","itinerary":[{"copy":"Arrive gently, settle into the island and follow ancient paths through forest and stone.","period":"Days 1–3","title":"Begin in the old kingdoms"},{"copy":"Take the slow train into tea country, walk the estates and dine by the fire as mist gathers.","period":"Days 4–7","title":"Move with the hills"},{"copy":"Trade mountain air for the coast, stopping at makers, markets and a secluded stay by the sea.","period":"Days 8–10","title":"Follow the road south"},{"copy":"Leave the final days open for saltwater, long lunches and one last Sri Lankan sunset.","period":"Days 11–12","title":"End without hurrying"}],"note":"Tea trails, quiet estates and mornings above the cloud line.","price":"From $2,480","route":"Colombo → Tea Country → South Coast","slug":"island-in-slow-motion","title":"The Island in Slow Motion","imageAlt":"The Island in Slow Motion"},{"days":"8 days","image":"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/fghpp67g/production/4084013af17f152369df9ac23ce75d3339c1c235-2200x1465.jpg?rect=35,0,2131,1465&w=1600&h=1100&fit=crop&auto=format","includedCopy":"Handpicked accommodation, daily breakfast, private transport, specialist hosts, selected experiences and 24/7 local assistance are included. International flights and travel insurance are excluded.","includedHeading":"Private by design.\nSupported throughout.","introCopy":"Every stay, transfer and encounter is handled. The rhythm remains spacious, and every detail can be changed around your interests.","introHeading":"A route with direction,\nnever a rigid schedule.","itinerary":[{"copy":"Arrive gently, settle into the island and follow ancient paths through forest and stone.","period":"Days 1–3","title":"Begin in the old kingdoms"},{"copy":"Take the slow train into tea country, walk the estates and dine by the fire as mist gathers.","period":"Days 4–7","title":"Move with the hills"},{"copy":"Trade mountain air for the coast, stopping at makers, markets and a secluded stay by the sea.","period":"Days 8–10","title":"Follow the road south"},{"copy":"Leave the final days open for saltwater, long lunches and one last Sri Lankan sunset.","period":"Days 11–12","title":"End without hurrying"}],"note":"Wild landscapes shaped around patient, respectful encounters.","price":"From $1,960","route":"Sigiriya → Gal Oya → Yala","slug":"wild-ceylon","title":"Wild Ceylon","imageAlt":"Wild Ceylon"},{"days":"10 days","image":"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/fghpp67g/production/9f8a351d105d9493429abd1b6f9942fcbf8ab8e7-2400x3200.jpg?rect=0,775,2400,1650&w=1600&h=1100&fit=crop&auto=format","includedCopy":"Handpicked accommodation, daily breakfast, private transport, specialist hosts, selected experiences and 24/7 local assistance are included. International flights and travel insurance are excluded.","includedHeading":"Private by design.\nSupported throughout.","introCopy":"Every stay, transfer and encounter is handled. The rhythm remains spacious, and every detail can be changed around your interests.","introHeading":"A route with direction,\nnever a rigid schedule.","itinerary":[{"copy":"Arrive gently, settle into the island and follow ancient paths through forest and stone.","period":"Days 1–3","title":"Begin in the old kingdoms"},{"copy":"Take the slow train into tea country, walk the estates and dine by the fire as mist gathers.","period":"Days 4–7","title":"Move with the hills"},{"copy":"Trade mountain air for the coast, stopping at makers, markets and a secluded stay by the sea.","period":"Days 8–10","title":"Follow the road south"},{"copy":"Leave the final days open for saltwater, long lunches and one last Sri Lankan sunset.","period":"Days 11–12","title":"End without hurrying"}],"note":"Old cities, southern ramparts and long evenings beside the sea.","price":"From $2,190","route":"Kandy → Galle → Mirissa","slug":"heritage-and-horizon","title":"Heritage & Horizon","imageAlt":"Heritage & Horizon"}]}]
